{"gospel":{"reference":"Luc 5, 1-11","title":"La pêche miraculeuse","interlinear":[{"verse_number":1,"translations":{"segond":"Comme Jésus se trouvait auprès du lac de Génésareth, et que la foule se pressait autour de lui pour entendre la parole de Dieu,","darby":"Et il arriva, comme la foule le pressait pour entendre la parole de Dieu, et qu'il se tenait sur le bord du lac de Génésareth,"},"interlinear":[{"greek":"Ἐγένετο","gloss":"Il_arriva"},{"greek":"δὲ","gloss":"or"},{"greek":"ἐν","gloss":"pendant"},{"greek":"τῷ","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"ὄχλον","gloss":"foule"},{"greek":"ἐπικεῖσθαι","gloss":"se_presser/s'imposer"},{"greek":"αὐτῷ","gloss":"sur_lui"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"ἀκούειν","gloss":"entendre"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"λόγον","gloss":"parole"},{"greek":"τοῦ","gloss":"de"},{"greek":"θεοῦ","gloss":"Dieu"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"αὐτὸς","gloss":"lui"},{"greek":"ἦν","gloss":"était"},{"greek":"ἑστὼς","gloss":"se_tenant_debout"},{"greek":"παρὰ","gloss":"près_de"},{"greek":"τὴν","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"λίμνην","gloss":"lac"},{"greek":"Γεννησαρέτ,","gloss":"Génésareth"}]},{"verse_number":2,"translations":{"segond":"il vit au bord du lac deux barques, d'où les pêcheurs étaient descendus pour laver leurs filets.","darby":"qu'il vit deux nacelles qui se trouvaient au bord du lac ; et les pêcheurs en étaient descendus et lavaient leurs filets."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"εἶδεν","gloss":"il_vit"},{"greek":"δύο","gloss":"deux"},{"greek":"πλοῖα","gloss":"barques"},{"greek":"ἑστῶτα","gloss":"se_tenant/arrêtées"},{"greek":"παρὰ","gloss":"près_de"},{"greek":"τὴν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"λίμνην·","gloss":"lac"},{"greek":"οἱ","gloss":"les"},{"greek":"δὲ","gloss":"or"},{"greek":"ἁλιεῖς","gloss":"pêcheurs"},{"greek":"ἀπ’","gloss":"de"},{"greek":"αὐτῶν","gloss":"elles"},{"greek":"ἀποβάντες","gloss":"étant_descendus"},{"greek":"ἔπλυνον","gloss":"lavaient"},{"greek":"τὰ","gloss":"l